name: Illusion — shop cards with enhancements
author: corpus
description: >-
  Illusion makes playing cards in the shop sometimes have an Enhancement and/or Edition.
  First-shop deck engine: pair with Magic Trick, Hologram, and Vampire.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Illusion
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - voucher: MagicTrick
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Hologram
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Vampire
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
